# Bringup and launch files

## Line 1 launch modes (public repo only)

| Launch | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| `sil_manual.launch.py` | Manual / bench — no autonomy |
| `sil_public.launch.py` | Recognition stack — perception + public BT through TRACK |

`sil_full.launch.py` (public + private) belongs in **private repo** Line 2+ — not here.

## Composition

- Include `dondron_bridge` (uXRCE agent) when bridging to PX4
- Set `ROS_DOMAIN_ID=42` via launch or env
- Document required external processes: Micro-XRCE agent, PX4 SITL (see `docs/sil-bridge.md`)

